<title>USA: Alcoa Q2 shr $1.19 vs $0.76.</title>
<headline>Alcoa Q2 shr $1.19 vs $0.76.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.19		    $0.76</p>
<p> Net		 207,600		  132,200</p>
<p> Revs		3,469,700		3,403,500</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $2.11		    $1.77</p>
<p> Net		 366,700		  310,400</p>
<p> Revs		6,742,100		6,518,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  173,324		  174,089</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Results for Q2 1997 include an after-tax loss of $7.1 million, or $0.04 per share, resulting from marking to market certain aluminim commodity contracts. In the year-earlier period results included an after-tax loss of $33.8 million, or $0.19 per share, for the same reason.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Aluminum Co of America.</p>
